// Riot's it_it Legends of Runeterra card text (Data Dragon via InFinity54 LoR_DDragon mirrors, sets 1–9), saved 2026-10-21.
// Also ATLAS_I18N_LOR_G = {sets: English set name → name, regions: nameRef → name, rarities: RARITY → name} from globals-it_it.json.
